  "description": "Gatekeeper for action-item commitments: title/owner/due-date rules and duplicate detection under validation_config. Pure and deterministic.\n\nImplemented and smoke-tested matrix (use_cases):\n- complete item validates (ok)\n- past due rejected when allow_past_due=false (validation_failed)\n- missing owner when require_owner=true (validation_failed)\n- duplicate title+owner (duplicate)\n- duplicate title-only check mode (duplicate)\n- invalid duplicate_check config (invalid_config)\n\nKnown limitations (intentional in 1.0.1):\n- Does not verify owner_id exists in a directory; only presence/absence\n- Date parsing is YYYY-MM-DD lexical compare only",
